==Swedish==
{{wikipedia|lang=sv}}

===Etymology===
From {{bor|sv|fi|Kiiruna}}, clipping of {{der|sv|se|Gironvárris||ptarmigan mountain}}, a mining mountain near the city which it was named after when it was founded. ''Giron'' was Finnishized to {{m|fi|Kiiruna}}, which was Swedishized to {{m|sv|Kiruna}}.

